      "primary_classification": "CUSTOM_CONTROL",
      "actual_behavior": "Specialized Pursuer goal kernel: target-driven attack goals require live target and source state, strict configured range; StompCombo/SingleSlash/Buckshot also attackDelay<=0, SwordTeleport/Chase strict min range without delay. All active constructors set MOVE/LOOK/JUMP, overload can supply flags. Start changes state, continuation clock<max AND active state. Look30/30 before see clock else yaw freeze. StompCombo stop3/4 via signed-overflow nextInt()*100<50 and cooldown0. SingleSlash stop accepted hasHit server11 then clears flag; miss finisherCD<=0 chooses12/14 using signed overflow, cooldown-active branch consumes random but both outcomes12; does not reset cooldown here. SingleSlashFrom accepted-hit and stunCD<=0 server9 then clears, else parent stop. Buckshot min distance5 and stop22/23 via signed-overflow random without cooldown reset. These four updateEveryTick=false. SwordTeleport stops supplied endstate/cooldown0; Chase stops19 when signed-overflow comparison true and finisherCD<=0 else endstate/cooldown0, both updateEveryTick=true. StabFinisher state goal start changes only different state, continuation positive final<= inclusive OR source+active state; stop success15/failure16, clock0/cooldown0, updateEveryTick=true; optional interruptsAI false sets no flags. Damage belongs to actor callbacks. Native alternating goal cleanup/callback schedule applies; grab clock39 with inclusive final39 is reachable.",
